324.     /// # Description
325.     ///
326.     /// Allocates the next fixed-size slot and reinterprets it as `MaybeUninit<T>`.
327.     ///
328.     /// # Returns
329.     ///
330.     /// On success, returns a mutable reference to an uninitialized `T`.
